omer et \u00eatre au plus pr\u00e8s des planches dessin\u00e9es.", "short_description": "Izneo est un service cross-plateformes permettant de lire des Mangas, BD, Webtoons et Comics.\nPour utiliser l'application vous devez poss\u00e9der un compte izneo (\u00e0 cr\u00e9er sur www.izneo.com).\nConnectez-vous \u00e0 votre compte et retrouvez vos albums \u00e0 lire en r\u00e9alit\u00e9 virtuelle dans des environnements configurables."}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "1080x360_bg.png", "id": "1205263993211836", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982727_1205263996545169_9148883512724487229_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=Rxgpf3LgKnYQ7kNvwGBVR_7&_nc_oc=AdpXaxuTzxbSOepgReHj6h6gXKFfNfC7YU95CKMKIGVdRxatKfxHBwMmfE2_DZWdpt0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af47hsFlt8XOFVjLvFO-Qf25ry0SVyUUdtwYoGNLlJ10nw&oe=6A1074B4"}, {"file_name": "512.png", "id": "1050334919080944", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984471_1050334922414277_3741888985697961122_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=JNLnM-fq3w8Q7kNvwEZn09g&_nc_oc=AdoGX0QkInVnrrV_nFbGjsVyz9wnGCCV9wtbpvLGKjOKWCJsVOqT1-wl-juFEB6DGqQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr8-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6J5E_n1wC4K6buVBqU0SMKEerBxpPdJyAXpunSEH5kQg&oe=6A107616"}, {"file_name": "2560x1440_bg.png", "id": "715429989842664", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982580_715429993175997_4462372464006952430_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=3xL4rK9rnwwQ7kNvwG7b4hJ&_nc_oc=AdqL8LFd_8Q32VmAwfdhHsMCrGzu-66CDj5tC3-9uN18we0UIOAPamifFsvnycnu_V0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af5YaZMhU-08nbrbt_UPmHqVnnXGvEdPoq3hPBZCNg0u5A&oe=6A1052F7"}, {"file_name": "3000x900_pdp-art-safezone.png", "id": "629709414781356", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://